Package: helpbuoy-desk
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Maurits van der Schee <maurits@vdschee.nl>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libx11-6, libgl1
Recommends: libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxinerama1, libxi6
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/helpbuoy/helpbuoy
Description: support desk for helpbuoy self-hosted remote support
 helpbuoy-desk is the app support techies use to see and control the
 screens of the people they help (helpbuoy on Windows and Linux). It
 connects to a helpbuoy-server, or runs one built in. The screen and
 input run end to end over an inner SSH connection the server can't read.
 .
 It brings its own raylib and opens its window through X11 (XWayland on a
 Wayland desktop).
